<article class="doc-block" data-doc-card data-doc-category="webhooks"><div class="doc-block-head"><b>Webhooks &amp; signatures</b><span>04</span></div><div class="doc-block-body"><p>Subscription management, HMAC-SHA256 verification, event types, delivery history and known delivery limits.</p><a href="#doc-webhooks">Open webhook guide \u2197</a></div></article>
