<article class="doc-block" data-doc-card data-doc-category="integrations"><div class="doc-block-head"><b>MCP &amp; integrations</b><span>07</span></div><div class="doc-block-body"><p>Read-only MCP prototype status, integration boundaries and what is not exposed in production.</p><a href="#doc-mcp">Open integration notes \u2197</a></div></article>
